# Business Analysis Project 1 –  Pacific Horizon

## 📄 Overview
This project focused on integrating a centralized customer feedback system for Pacific Horizon

## 🧩 Problem Statement
The client faced struggles with fragmented, inconsistent, and delayed feedback processes for its guests. 

## 🧠 Approach
- Technology Enablement - Deploy a centralized, cloud-based CFMS capable of aggregating guest feedback from in-person notes, surveys, and third-party review platforms.   
- Process Standardization - Develop a closed-loop feedback process to ensure every issue is acknowledged, tracked, and resolved.
  
## 🛠 Tools Used
- MS Word
- MS Excel
- Confluence / Trello  
- draw.io
